          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n        2 Bakyab 14:23—15:7; 15:32—16:20; 18:1—20:21; 2 Byom 26:1—27:8; 28:1—32:33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buno n'obukwenda Musengwa Katonda bwe yatuma Hosea mutabane wa Beeri, mu biseera bakyabazinga bano bye baafugiramu Buyudaaya: Uzzia, Yothamu, Ahazi, ni Hezekia. Era ni mu biseera kyabazinga Yeroboamu mutabane wa Yehoashi bye yafugiramu Isiraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
