        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.10.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bakyab 10:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Musengwa Katonda yaakoba Hosea ati: “Mutuume eriina ‘Yezireeli,’ kuba esigaireyo ekiseera kitono mbonereze kyabazinga wa Isiraeli olw'obutemo dhaadha we Yehu bwe yakolera e Yezireeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1:4:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Yezireeli:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mu kibuga ekyo Yehu mwe yatemulira kyabazinga wa Isiraeli ghalala n'ab'oku lulyo lwa kyabazinga oyo boonaboona. Olwo Yehu oyo yaafuuka kyabazinga eyasooka mu bufuzi obw'ab'oku nda ya Yehu (Bona 2 Bakyab Enkenga 9–10).",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nja kulekeza ab'oku nda ya Yehu okufuga obwakyabazinga bwa Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era mu kiseera ekyo, ndisaaniagho eby'okulwanisa bya Isiraeli mu kyetebwa Ekiiko ky'e Yezireeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
